-------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
[GNRWS] Add boot mode check for MOR

[Issue Description]
Fail to capsule update due to memory wipe.

[Resolution]
Add a boot-mode check to prevent unintended memory wipe during firmware
capsule/flash updates. The code retrieves the current boot mode and
skips setting WipeMemory when the system is in BOOT_ON_FLASH_UPDATE,
while preserving the existing MOR clear-memory behavior for other boot
modes. This avoids clearing memory during an on-flash update sequence
and ensures the MOR control is still honored outside update scenarios.

[Package/Module]
ServerPlatformPkg

[Impacted Platform]
GNR WS

